        {
          "text": " Basi Sulemani akaenda mahali pa juu pa Gibeoni, na kusanyiko lote naye; kwani ndipo lilipokuwako hema la kukutania la Mungu, alilolifanya Musa mtumishi wa BWANA jangwani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
