        {
          "text": " Naye Mungu akamwambia Sulemani, Kwa sababu neno hili lilikuwamo moyoni mwako, wala hukujitakia mali, wala utajiri, wala utukufu, wala maisha ya wakuchukiao, wala hukujitakia maisha ya siku nyingi; bali umejitakia hekima na maarifa, upate kuwatawala watu wangu, niliokutawaza juu yao; ",
